cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ThreatMamba reproduction
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both this repository and the original
  ThreatMAMBA paper listed under references.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/<your-username>/threatmamba-repro"
abstract: >-
  An open reproduction of the ThreatMAMBA pipeline for cyber threat attribution:
  IOC/TTP extraction from CTI reports, construction of a 19-node-type cybersecurity
  knowledge graph, and a relational GAT + MAMBA classifier, with MITRE ATT&CK based
  explanations and a Streamlit demo UI.
keywords:
  - cyber threat intelligence
  - threat attribution
  - knowledge graph
  - state space model
  - MITRE ATT&CK
references:
  - type: article
    title: "ThreatMAMBA"
    journal: "IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security"
    year: 2026
    doi: "10.1109/TIFS.2026.3685967"
